OR lines joined by newlines, 205 bytes, which passes every content check in verify.sh and fails only the size test."}}, "prev_event_id": "evt-84a39db92c39f453", "protocol_version": "0.1.0-pilot", "sequence": 8, "session_id": "sess-1a20d5296c11065e", "task_id": "task-4736271cd3f3", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T22:19:57.348Z", "tool_call_id": "Zl5aT407otAUyqRuOkFf9Ws3JTsknbk4", "type": "dissent_hold_entered"}
